
### 1. Get Current Inventory
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1


### 2. Get Existing Batches
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/inventory/1


### 3. Receive Batch A - Expiring Soon
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/receive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "batchNumber": "APPLE-2026-001",
  "quantity": 30,
  "manufacturedDate": "2026-11-15",
  "expiryDate": "2026-11-23",
  "referenceNumber": "PO-2001",
  "reason": "Gala apples delivery batch A"
}


### 4. Receive Batch B
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/receive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "batchNumber": "APPLE-2026-002",
  "quantity": 50,
  "manufacturedDate": "2026-11-16",
  "expiryDate": "2026-11-28",
  "referenceNumber": "PO-2002",
  "reason": "Gala apples delivery batch B"
}


### 5. Receive Batch C
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/receive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "batchNumber": "APPLE-2026-003",
  "quantity": 70,
  "manufacturedDate": "2026-11-17",
  "expiryDate": "2026-12-05",
  "referenceNumber": "PO-2003",
  "reason": "Gala apples delivery batch C"
}


### 6. Get All Inventory Batches
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/inventory/1


### 7. Get Batch Details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/1


### 8. Get Expiring Soon - Default 7 Days
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/store/1/expiring-soon


### 9. Get Expiring Within 30 Days
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/store/1/expiring-soon?days=30


### 10. Get Expired Batches
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/store/1/expired


### 11. Sale - FEFO Allocation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "SALE",
  "quantity": 40,
  "referenceNumber": "SALE-2001",
  "reason": "FEFO allocation testing"
}


### 12. Verify Batch Quantities After Sale
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/inventory/1


### 13. Record Damaged Apples From Batch B
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "DAMAGE",
  "quantity": 5,
  "batchNumber": "APPLE-2026-002",
  "referenceNumber": "DMG-2001",
  "reason": "Damaged during shelf stocking"
}


### 14. Return Resellable Stock
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "RETURN",
  "quantity": 3,
  "batchNumber": "APPLE-RETURN-001",
  "expiryDate": "2026-11-28",
  "referenceNumber": "RET-2001",
  "reason": "Inspected resellable customer return"
}


### 15. Positive Stock Adjustment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "ADJUSTMENT",
  "quantity": 4,
  "batchNumber": "APPLE-ADJUSTMENT-001",
  "expiryDate": "2026-12-05",
  "referenceNumber": "ADJ-2001",
  "reason": "Additional stock discovered during counting"
}


### 16. Negative Stock Adjustment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "ADJUSTMENT",
  "quantity": -2,
  "batchNumber": "APPLE-2026-003",
  "referenceNumber": "ADJ-2002",
  "reason": "Physical stock count correction"
}


### 17. Get Batch Movement History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/1/movements


### 18. Get Stock Movement History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements/inventory/1


### 19. Verify Aggregate Inventory
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1


### 20. Verify All Batches
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/inventory/1


### ============================================
### NEGATIVE TEST CASES
### ============================================

### 21. Duplicate Batch - Expect 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/receive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "batchNumber": "APPLE-2026-001",
  "quantity": 30,
  "expiryDate": "2026-11-23"
}


### 22. Receive Expired Batch - Expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/receive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "batchNumber": "APPLE-EXPIRED-001",
  "quantity": 20,
  "expiryDate": "2026-10-01"
}


### 23. Invalid Batch Dates - Expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/receive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "batchNumber": "APPLE-INVALID-DATE",
  "quantity": 20,
  "manufacturedDate": "2026-11-17",
  "expiryDate": "2026-11-16"
}


### 24. Insufficient Stock - Expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "SALE",
  "quantity": 999999,
  "reason": "Insufficient stock testing"
}


### 25. Damage Without Batch Number - Expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "DAMAGE",
  "quantity": 5,
  "reason": "Missing batch number testing"
}


### 26. Unknown Batch Number - Expect 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "DAMAGE",
  "quantity": 1,
  "batchNumber": "UNKNOWN-BATCH"
}


### 27. Invalid Quantity - Expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/receive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "batchNumber": "APPLE-INVALID-QTY",
  "quantity": 0
}


### 28. Unknown Batch ID - Expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/999999


### 29. Unknown Inventory - Expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/batches/inventory/999999


### 30. Final Inventory Verification
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1
